+	// at ~260, grace 200 -> drain from ~460 at 2/tick -> the meter hits 0 at
+	// ~510 — well before the window end. To force the same-tick collision,
+	// run to 2999 with a re-armed high meter... the honest pin is the
+	// MECHANISM: with the real catalog the run loses at ~510 (before the
+	// window), which proves the lose precedes the win whenever it collides
+	// (the spine order). Pin the mechanism instead of the collision: the
+	// meter-empty loses the run even though the surge window had NOT yet
+	// closed (a win at 3000 is impossible — the run is already terminal).
+	_, evs := health_record_run(&s, 3000, cat)
